# Per IEEE 1516.1-2010 §4.2, §4.9, §5.3, §6.20, §5.10 (catalogue row
# 4.16), §4.10. CRITICAL: START_REGISTRATION fires EXACTLY ONCE — only
# after the subscriber's active=true subscribe, NOT after its passive
# (active=false) subscribe (catalogue row 11.9).
PUB: CONNECT
PUB: JOIN federate=publisher
PUB: PUBLISH class=Vehicle attributes=[Position]
PUB: ADVISORY_SWITCH=ObjectClassRelevance
PUB: START_REGISTRATION class=Vehicle
PUB: RESIGN
